Macro mark
----------
The three-stroke "M" mark used in the app icon (src-tauri/icons, public/macro-espresso.svg)
and in the UI (src/components/rail.css) is Macro's logo. Its outline comes from
macro-inc/macro (https://github.com/macro-inc/macro), which is licensed under AGPL-3.0,
and the name and mark are Macro's trademarks. They are NOT covered by the MIT License in
this repository. Macro Espresso is an independent personal project and is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Macro. If you redistribute this app, replace the mark with your own.

Brand icons
-----------
The WhatsApp and Spotify marks (src/brand-icons.tsx) are path data from Simple Icons
(CC0-1.0); the names and marks belong to their owners and are used only to label the tabs
that open those services. The Paperclip mark is from Paperclip (MIT). The "T3" glyph is
drawn for this project.

Third-party tools
-----------------
Macro Espresso runs, but does not include, these tools:
  - T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code), MIT
  - Paperclip (https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip), MIT
  - astro-mdx-editor by Benji Tusk (https://github.com/benjitusk/astro-mdx-editor), MIT
tools/patch-paperclip.mjs edits an installed copy of Paperclip on Windows; it ships none
of Paperclip's code.
